  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3806 specifies the high-level and functional requirements of quality of service (QoS) assurance for quantum key distribution networks (QKDN). The functional requirements include QoS planning, QoS monitoring, QoS optimization, QoS provisioning, QoS protection and recovery.</abstract>
